<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002Q_S000F" variety="S000F">
<name>Navigation</name>
<ttl id="1002Q_S000F_746OU_T00CJ" variety="T00CJ">
<name>HDD Navigation System</name>
<para id="RM0000035BU01CX" category="C" type-id="803ME" name-id="653FT-01" from="200912">
<dtccode>B15D7</dtccode>
<dtcname>ETC not connected</dtcname>
<dtccode>B1598</dtccode>
<dtcname>No response from ETC device</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000035BU01CX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000II800000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The HDD navigation system uses AVC-LAN for communication between devices. If a malfunction such as a short between communication lines, short to +B or short to GND occurs in the AVC-LAN circuit, communication is interrupted and the HDD navigation system does not operate normally.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000035BU01CX_06" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIH00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.71in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.80in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.57in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B15D7</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC cannot be used</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC cannot be operated</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC itself can be used, but does not appear on the ETC setting screen</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC usage history is not displayed</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Navigation Receiver Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B1598</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>No response from ETC</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Communication between devices via AVC-LAN may malfunction due to the effects of noise, etc.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000035BU01CX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000II900000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122328J28" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000035BU01CX_05" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIG00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Depending on the part replaced, setting work may be necessary. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000002RM03SX"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000035BU01CX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IID00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the DTCs following the screen. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ05TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen display and clear the DTCs following the screen.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0010" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIE00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs again and proceed to the destination below. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ05TX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>No code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0001" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0011" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIA00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly +B, ACC, GND)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Resistance and Voltage</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance and voltage between each terminal of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly vehicle side wire harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A1 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A8 (+B) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A7 (ACC) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ACC ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIB00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Navigation Receiver Assembly (TX+, TX-)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect all connectors of the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101112J38" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the navigation receiver assembly connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D9(TX+) - D10(TX-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>60 to 80 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*a</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Connector Disconnected</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Navigation Receiver Assembly)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IGN00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Navigation Receiver Assembly - Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector D of the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals of the vehicle wire harness between the navigation receiver assembly and toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D9(TX+) - A5(TX+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D10(TX-) - A4(TX-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each connector terminal of the navigation receiver assembly vehicle side wire harness and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D9 (TX+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D10 (TX-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIC00000">
<testtitle>Replace Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly with a new one. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002TPV001X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0012" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IIF00000">
<testtitle>Operation Check</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Area Around Antenna</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any obstructions around the navigation antenna assembly (top surface of the instrument panel), and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any film, stickers, etc. affixed to the windshield glass, and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect with ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E195388J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using an ETC on-board unit tester, check that the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly is performing wireless communication normally.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Operate the ETC on-board unit tester at a position approximately 1m from the windshield glass, on a line extending upward and forward of the vehicle from the navigation antenna assembly at an elevation angle of 67±15°. ((The distance between the ETC on-board unit tester and the antenna is only a guide)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Point the communication surface of the ETC on-board unit tester toward the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not bring the ETC on-board unit tester too close to the navigation antenna assembly, as communication with the tester may be established even if the antenna is disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Setup</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Perform setup.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Using ETC Card</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Insert an ETC card into the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly and check that the card is authenticated normally.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0005" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0005">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0011">
<testtitle>End (communication malfunction due to the effects of noise, etc.)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0006">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0007">
<testtitle>Replace Navigation Receiver Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001XG5006X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000035BU01CX_03_0008">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
